              "left": 60,
              "top": 150,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 88,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Prepare for the LAN110 evaluation by explaining key terms in English and drafting a 300-word report on a financial reporting assignment.</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
